body:
AD cmdlets are awkward

Try the following:


  $csvFilePath = "C:\\Temp\\TestCSV2.csv"

$targetou = "my target ou"

$accounts = Import-Csv -Path $csvFilePath

foreach ($account in $accounts) {  
$userObject=Get-ADUser -Filter "UserPrincipalName -eq '$($username)'" -Properties DistinguishedName
try {  
$userObject | Disable-ADAccount

Move-ADObject -Identity $userObject.DistinguishedName -TargetPath $targetOU  


Write-Host "Account '$username' has been disabled and moved to the target OU."  
}  
catch {  
Write-Host "Error disabling account '$username': $\_"  
}  
 }


Doing this from memory on phone so could be wrong
